----                             5827  ; Thin AmigaOS CLI smoke wrapper for the package-backed tkpkg runtime.
----                             5828  ;
----                             5829  ; This slice exercises init, load_package, set_pipeline, tokenize_line, and
----                             5830  ; last_error without folding CLI/report concerns into the core runtime modules.
----                             5831  
